  <element>
    <id>UMLNote</id>
    <coordinates>
      <x>80</x>
      <y>880</y>
      <w>1180</w>
      <h>370</h>
    </coordinates>
    <panel_attributes>Node table (days = base x 1.75 junior x 1.5 reliable = base x 2.625 dev-days)
--
Edge | Dev | Days | Package | Modules (base days)
A-B | Dev2 | 10.5 | DB design | Database design 3, Database migrations 1
A-D | Dev1 | 21 | Setup and CI | Testing and CI 3, RPC / service contracts 4, Logging and monitoring 1
A-E | Dev3 | 21 | UI shell | UI 8
B-C | Dev4 | 9.19 | Course catalog + campus | Course catalog data 2, Campus map 1, McGill links redirection 0.5
B-E | Dev2 | 21 | Sign-in and security | Sign-in and accounts 3, Authorization / permissions 2, Email verification 1, Security and rate limiting 2
E-F | Dev6 | 15.75 | Posts core | Posts 3, Follows 1.5, Image upload 1.5
E-G | Dev5 | 18.38 | Messaging | Instant messaging 5, Chat attachments 1, Chat search 1
E-I | Dev4 | 21 | Seat Alert + Averages | Seat Alert 5, Course Averages 3
E-J | Dev7 | 21 | Profiles, settings, payment | User profiles 2, QR code profile sharing 0.5, Settings 1, French language support 2, Import / export 1, Payment system 1.5
F-G | Dev6 | 10.5 | Tags and badges | Course tags 1, Industry / research tags 1, Verified alumni / industry badge 2
F-H | Dev1 | 17.06 | Post interactions | Comments 1.5, Likes 1, Mentions 1, Saved posts 1, Search 2
F-I | Dev3 | 10.5 | Safety | Moderation / admin 2.5, Block and mute users 1, Feedback / ticketing 0.5
H-I | Dev6 | 15.75 | Performance + offline | Cache layer 2, Index tuning and query performance 1, Offline storage 3
H-J | Dev5 | 21 | Notifications + MQ | Message queue (MQ) layer 4, In-app notifications 2, Push notifications 1, SMS 0.5, Email 0.5
J-K | Dev7 | 18.38 | Deploy + integration test | Deployment / DevOps 4, Performance / load testing 2, Backup 0.5, App updates 0.5
C-E | - | 0 | (waiting) | catalog data is a foundation
D-E | - | 0 | (waiting) | setup done before features
G-H | - | 0 | (waiting) | notifications need messaging; Dev6 free after tags
I-J | - | 0 | (waiting) | side features done</panel_attributes>
    <additional_attributes></additional_attributes>
  </element>
  <element>
    <id>UMLNote</id>
    <coordinates>
      <x>1300</x>
      <y>880</y>
      <w>640</w>
      <h>120</h>
    </coordinates>
    <panel_attributes>Legend
--
Circle = event (all incoming tasks finished), day = earliest time
Solid arrow = task: work package, owner and duration (dev-days, 1 dev-day = 8 h)
Dashed arrow = waiting dependency (0 days, no work)
Red bold = critical path (zero slack)</panel_attributes>
    <additional_attributes></additional_attributes>
  </element>
  <element>
    <id>UMLNote</id>
    <coordinates>
      <x>1300</x>
      <y>1020</y>
      <w>640</w>
      <h>230</h>
    </coordinates>
    <panel_attributes>Total: 252 dev-days (96 base days x 2.625), what the team pays for
Optimal: 103.69 days = critical path A-B-E-F-H-J-K
  = 10.5 + 21 + 15.75 + 17.06 + 21 + 18.38
Practical (7 devs): 103.69 days, the assignment adds no delay
--
Developer load (fair share 252 / 7 = 36):
Dev1: P1 + P7 = 38.06 days
Dev2: P2 + P4 = 31.5 days
Dev3: P3 + P9 = 31.5 days
Dev4: P12 + P13 = 30.19 days
Dev5: P10 + P11 = 39.38 days
Dev6: P6 + P8 + P14 = 42 days
Dev7: P5 + P15 = 39.38 days</panel_attributes>
    <additional_attributes></additional_attributes>
  </element>
